e, I\'ll show you where everything is — right in the app, screen by screen.', navDashTitle: 'The dashboard', navDashBody: 'Everything starts here. Click this menu item at any time to return to your overview.', statsTitle: 'Your live indicators', statsBody: 'Collections, unpaid charges, incidents, units: these cards update in real time. Tap one to open the details.', navFinancesTitle: 'Finances', navFinancesBody: 'Funds calls, budgets and disputes live in this section of the menu. Let\'s look at the funds calls.', appelsPageTitle: 'Funds calls', appelsPageBody: 'Each call shows who has paid and what is still due. Open a line for the breakdown by unit — and create a new call from the button at the top of the page.', navAgTitle: 'General meetings', navAgBody: 'Notices of meeting, agendas, votes in session and minutes: the residence\'s entire democratic life is behind this item.', navIncidentsTitle: 'Incidents', navIncidentsBody: 'A leak, a breakdown? This is where everything is reported and tracked. Let\'s go.', incidentsPageTitle: 'Incident tracking', incidentsPageBody: 'Each incident has an urgency, a status and a response deadline. The button at the top of the page lets you report a new one.', navDocsTitle: 'Documents', navDocsBody: 'The residence\'s rules, minutes, contracts and receipts, all in one place. Last step of the tour.', docViewTitle: 'Read without downloading', docViewBody: 'The “View” button opens the document directly in the app — on computer and phone alike.', searchTitle: 'Quick search', searchBody: 'Type the name of a page to go there instantly, without using the menu.', bellTitle: 'Your notifications', bellBody: 'Payments, notices of meeting, replies to your reports: everything that concerns you arrives here.', doneTitle: 'You\'re ready!', doneBody: 'You now know the essentials. And if a question comes up, I\'m right here at the bottom of the screen. Welcome to your residence!', clickHint: 'Click the highlighted item to continue', adminNavTitle: 'Your console', adminNavBody: 'All the platform\'s residences live here. Your role: create them and invite their property manager — each property manager then runs their own space.', adminNewTitle: 'Create a residence', adminNewBody: 'Two steps, all in the interface: the residence, then the property manager\'s invitation code to pass on. No passwords to manage.', dariTitle: 'And I\'m Dari', dariBody: 'Your assistant. I know your residence and every screen of the app: ask me anything at any time, I\'ll answer and take you to the right place.'), dari: DictDari(nom: 'Dari', sousTitre: 'Your SyndicUp assistant', ouvrir: 'Ask Dari', fermer: 'Close the assistant', nouvelle: 'New conversation', bonjour: 'Hello {prenom}! I\'m Dari.', intro: 'I know your residence and the app. Here\'s what matters today:', introMoi: '{role} · {residence} ({lots}). I know your file and every screen of the app — here\'s what matters today:', etatErreur: 'I can\'t read your file right now.', rienAFaire: 'Nothing urgent for now — everything is in order.', suggestionsTitre: 'You can ask me', placeholder: 'Ask your question…', envoyer: 'Send', reflechit: 'Dari is thinking…', ecrit: 'Dari is typing…', ouvrirEcran: 'Open', indisponible: 'Chat is not yet enabled for this space. The pointers above stay up to date.', sature: 'I\'m very busy right now — please try again in a few seconds.', trop: 'You\'ve asked me a lot of questions: let\'s take a short break for a few minutes.', erreur: 'I couldn\'t reply. Check your connection and try again.', reessayer: 'Try again', avertissement: 'Dari can make mistakes: check amounts on the relevant screen.', bulleTitre: 'A question?', bulleTexte: 'I\'m Dari, your assistant. I guide you everywhere in the app.', chargement: 'Dari is looking at your residence…'), comptabilite: DictComptabilite(appeleResident: 'My share called', regle: 'Paid', resteAPayer: 'Left to pay', partReglee: 'Share paid', parMoisAideResident: 'What you were called for and what you paid, period by